caption: Veiled — Illusion
tradition-component: veiled-illusion

Veiled grants Illusion as the Dreadhound's fixed Path Power Talent.

Veiled may add Glamour to any otherwise eligible Psi trait, using the normal Glamour value, resistance, and compatibility rules. Glamour represents the Veiled predator intruding on the observer's perception rather than merely hiding in the physical environment: a subject that fails to resist may simply fail to perceive, recognize, or correctly interpret the Dreadhound's manifested ability even when an unaffected machine or sufficiently resistant observer can detect what is really present. Veiled therefore hunts by making the prey's own mind an unreliable witness.
